<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!-- FontFamily used throughout this app is "Segoe MDL2 Assets" specifically — NOT "Segoe Fluent
     Icons". The two fonts share most codepoints but not all; trusting Fluent Icons docs for an
     MDL2 Assets glyph caused a real regression here (IconClock E917 renders as tofu on MDL2 Assets).
     Every key in this file has been rendered with System.Drawing against the actual installed
     "Segoe MDL2 Assets" font on a real Windows machine and visually confirmed on 2026-08-10 —
     not just cross-checked against documentation. Re-run that render check before trusting a new key. -->
